{"subject":"math","year":2011,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math-2011-1","num":1,"desc":"拐点","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(C)","【解析】法一：在区间[1,2]上，$\\dfrac{f(1)+f(2)}{2}=0, f\\left(\\dfrac{1+2}{2}\\right)<0$，$f(x)$ 为凹函数；","在区间[2,3]上，$\\dfrac{f(2)+f(3)}{2}=0, f\\left(\\dfrac{2+3}{2}\\right)<0$，$f(x)$ 为凹函数；","在区间[3,4]上，$\\dfrac{f(3)+f(4)}{2}=0, f\\left(\\dfrac{3+4}{2}\\right)>0$，$f(x)$ 为凸函数.","在点 $(3,0)$ 左右函数凹凸性发生改变，所以点 $(3,0)$ 为拐点.","法二：原函数可看成 $y=p(x)(x-3)^{3}$. 经计算可得 $y''(3)=0,y'''(3)\\neq0$，所以 $(3,0)$ 是曲线的拐点. 其他点不能满足充分条件."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-2","num":2,"desc":"幂级数收敛域","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(C)","【解析】根据部分和数列无界，所以级数 $\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{\\infty}a_{k}$ 发散，可知 $\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{\\infty}a_{k}x^{k}$ 在 $x=1$ 发散；$x=-1$ 时为交错级数，根据题意收敛，所以可判断收敛半径为 $R=1$，收敛域是 $[-1,1)$. 所以","$\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{\\infty}a_{k}(x-1)^{k}$ 的收敛域为 $\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{\\infty}a_{k}x^{k}$ 即 $x\\in[0,2)$."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-3","num":3,"desc":"二元函数极值判别","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(A)","【解析】由于 $\\begin{cases}z'_{x}=f'(x)g(y)=0\\\\ z'_{y}=f(x)g'(y)=0\\end{cases}$，满足","$z''_{xx}=f''(x)g(y)$, $z''_{yy}=f(x)g''(y)$, $z''_{xy}=f'(x)g'(y)$","对于点 $(0,0)$","$A=z''_{xx}(0,0)=f''(0)g(0)$, $B=z''_{xy}=f'(0)g'(0)$, $C=z''_{yy}=f(0)g''(0)$","已知 $f(0)>0,g(0)<0$，$f'(0)=g'(0)=0$.","当 $f''(0)<0,g''(0)>0$ 时，$AC-B^{2}>0$ 且 $A>0$，此时 $f(0,0)$ 是极小值."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-4","num":4,"desc":"定积分大小比较","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(B)","【解析】在区间 $\\left(0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$ 上，$\\sin x<\\cos x<\\cot x$，且 $\\ln x$ 是增函数，所以","$\\ln(\\sin x)<\\ln(\\cos x)<\\ln(\\cot x)$","由定积分比较大小的性质可知，应选 (B)."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-5","num":5,"desc":"初等矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(D).","【解析】由初等变换及初等矩阵的性质易知 $\\boldsymbol{P}_{2}\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{P}_{1}=\\boldsymbol{E}$，从而 $\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{P}_{2}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{P}_{1}^{-1}=\\boldsymbol{P}_{2}\\boldsymbol{P}_{1}^{-1}$，选 (D)."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-6","num":6,"desc":"伴随矩阵的秩","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(D).","【解析】由于 $(1,0,1,0)^{T}$ 是方程组 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 的一个基础解析. 故","$\\boldsymbol{A}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{4})\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}=0$","即 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}$ 与 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$ 线性相关，排除 (A)、(C)","又由于 $r(\\boldsymbol{A}^{*})=\\begin{cases}4,&r(\\boldsymbol{A})=4\\\\1,&r(\\boldsymbol{A})=3\\\\0,&r(\\boldsymbol{A})<3\\end{cases}$，知道 $r(\\boldsymbol{A}^{*})$ 不可能为 2，排除 (B)","选 (D)"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-7","num":7,"desc":"概率密度","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(D).","【解析】由概率密度的性质知，概率密度必须满足 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x)dx=1$，故由题知","$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\left[f_{1}(x)F_{2}(x)+f_{2}(x)F_{1}(x)\\right]dx=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}dF_{1}(x)F_{2}(x)=F_{1}(x)F_{2}(x)\\Big|_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}=1$","故选择 (D)"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-8","num":8,"desc":"随机变量的独立性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】(B).","【解析】由题知 $UV=XY$，且 $X,Y$ 独立，故有","$E(UV)=E(XY)=EX\\cdot EY$","故选择 (B)."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-9","num":9,"desc":"弧长公式","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\ln(\\sqrt{2}+1)$","【解析】由弧长公式知","$s=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\sqrt{1+(y')^{2}}dx$","$=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\sqrt{1+\\tan^{2}x}dx=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\sec xdx$","$=\\ln|\\sec x+\\tan x|\\Big|_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\ln(\\sqrt{2}+1)$"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-10","num":10,"desc":"一阶线性微分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$e^{-x}\\sin x$","【解析】由一阶线性微分方程的求解公式","$y=e^{-\\int1dx}(C+\\int e^{-x}\\cos x\\cdot e^{\\int1dx}dx)=e^{-x}(C+\\sin x)$","由于 $y(0)=0$，所以 $y=e^{-x}\\sin x$."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-11","num":11,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】4","【解析】由题意知","$\\dfrac{\\partial F}{\\partial x}=\\dfrac{\\sin(xy)}{1+(xy)^{2}}y$，$\\dfrac{\\partial F}{\\partial x}\\Big|_{y=2}=\\dfrac{2\\sin2x}{1+4x^{2}}$","$\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}F}{\\partial x^{2}}\\Big|_{x=0,y=2}=\\dfrac{\\partial\\left(\\dfrac{\\partial F}{\\partial x}\\Big|_{y=2}\\right)}{\\partial x}\\Bigg|_{x=0}=\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{2\\sin2x}{1+4x^{2}}\\right)\\Bigg|_{x=0}=\\dfrac{4\\cos2x\\cdot(1+4x^{2})-8x\\cdot2\\sin2x}{(1+4x^{2})^{2}}\\Bigg|_{x=0}=4$","【注】这里对 $x$ 求偏导，$y$ 当成常量看待，所以可以把先 $y=2$ 代入再对 $x$ 偏导"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-12","num":12,"desc":"斯托克斯公式","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\pi$","【解析】方法一：利用斯托克斯公式","$I=\\oint_{L}xz\\,dx+x\\,dy+\\dfrac{y^{2}}{2}dz=\\iint\\limits_{\\Sigma}\\begin{vmatrix}-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\\\ \\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial x}&\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial y}&\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial z}\\\\ xz&x&\\dfrac{y^{2}}{2}\\end{vmatrix}dS$","$=\\iint\\limits_{\\Sigma}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}(1-x-y)dS=\\iint\\limits_{x^{2}+y^{2}\\leqslant1}(1-x-y)dxdy=\\iint\\limits_{x^{2}+y^{2}\\leqslant1}dxdy$","$=\\pi$","方法二：将 $L$ 的方程化为参数方程形式：$\\begin{cases}x=\\cos t\\\\ y=\\sin t\\\\ z=\\cos t+\\sin t\\end{cases},(0\\leqslant t\\leqslant2\\pi)$，则","$I=\\oint_{L}xz\\,dx+x\\,dy+\\dfrac{y^{2}}{2}dz$","$=\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}\\left[\\cos t\\cdot(\\cos t+\\sin t)\\cdot(-\\sin t)+\\cos t\\cdot\\cos t+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sin^{2}t(-\\sin t+\\cos t)\\right]dt$","$=\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}\\cos^{2}tdt=\\int_{0}^{2\\pi}\\dfrac{1+\\cos2t}{2}dt$","$=\\pi$"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-13","num":13,"desc":"二次型矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】1","【解析】由题意知二次型矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&a&1\\\\a&3&1\\\\1&1&1\\end{pmatrix}$ 的特征值为 0,1,4，故","$|\\boldsymbol{A}|=\\begin{vmatrix}1&a&1\\\\a&3&1\\\\1&1&1\\end{vmatrix}=0$","解得 $a=1$"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-14","num":14,"desc":"二维正态分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\mu(\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2})$","【解析】由题知 $X$ 与 $Y$ 的相关系数 $\\rho_{XY}=0$，即 $X$ 与 $Y$ 不相关.","当 $(X,Y)$ 服从二维正态分布，$X$ 与 $Y$ 不相关 $\\Leftrightarrow$ $X$ 与 $Y$ 独立","所以 $X$ 与 $Y$ 独立，则有","$EX=EY=\\mu, DX=DY=\\sigma^{2}$","$EY^{2}=DY+(EY)^{2}=\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2}$","$E\\left(XY^{2}\\right)=EXEY^{2}=\\mu\\left(\\mu^{2}+\\sigma^{2}\\right)$."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-15","num":15,"desc":"1^∞ 型极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】这是个 $1^{\\infty}$ 型极限","$I=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\left[\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{x}\\right]^{\\frac{1}{e^{x}-1}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}e^{\\frac{1}{e^{x}-1}\\ln\\left[\\frac{\\ln(1+x)}{x}\\right]}$","$=e^{\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{1}{e^{x}-1}\\left(\\frac{\\ln(1+x)}{x}-1\\right)}=e^{\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\ln(1+x)-x}{x^{2}}}$","$=e^{\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{\\frac{1}{1+x}-1}{2x}}=e^{\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\frac{-x}{2x(1+x)}}$","$=e^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-16","num":16,"desc":"多元复合函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】由于 $g(x)$ 可导且在 $x=1$ 处取得极值，故必有 $g'(1)=0$.","由题又知 $\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}=f'_{1}\\cdot y+f'_{2}\\cdot yg'(x)$，所以 $\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\Big|_{x=1}=f'_{1}(y,y)\\cdot y$. 所以","$\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}z}{\\partial x\\partial y}\\Big|_{\\substack{x=1\\\\ y=1}}=\\dfrac{d}{dy}\\left(\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\Big|_{x=1}\\right)\\Bigg|_{y=1}=\\dfrac{d}{dy}\\left(f'_{1}(y,y)\\cdot y\\right)\\Bigg|_{y=1}$","$=\\left[f''_{11}(y,y)+f''_{12}(y,y)\\right]y+f'_{1}(y,y)\\Big|_{y=1}.$","$=f''_{11}(1,1)+f''_{12}(1,1)+f'_{1}(1,1)$"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-17","num":17,"desc":"方程实根个数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】令 $F(x)=k\\arctan x-x$，则 $F(x)$ 为奇函数，故只需考虑 $x\\in[0,+\\infty)$ 部分.","又 $F(0)=0$，求得 $F'(x)=\\dfrac{k}{1+x^{2}}-1=\\dfrac{k-1-x^{2}}{1+x^{2}}$","（1）当 $k-1\\leqslant0$，即 $k\\leqslant1$，$F'(x)<0(x>0)$，$F(x)$ 在 $(0,+\\infty)$ 上无零点；","（2）当 $k-1>0$，即 $k>1$ 时，$F(x)$ 在 $\\left(0,\\sqrt{k-1}\\right)$ 单调增加，在 $\\left(\\sqrt{k-1},+\\infty\\right)$ 单调减少.","在 $x=\\sqrt{k-1}$ 时，函数 $F(x)$ 取得最大值，且","$F\\left(\\sqrt{k-1}\\right)>F(0)=0$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}F(x)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to+\\infty}x\\left(\\dfrac{k\\arctan x}{x}-1\\right)=-\\infty$","则 $F(x)$ 在 $\\left(\\sqrt{k-1},+\\infty\\right)$ 内有一个零点","综上所述：当 $k\\leqslant1$ 时，原方程有一个实根；当 $k>1$ 时，原方程有三个实根."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-18","num":18,"desc":"拉格朗日中值定理","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【证明】①令 $f(x)=\\ln x(x>0)$，对任意正整数 $n$，由拉格朗日中值定理得","$\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{n})=\\ln(1+n)-\\ln n=\\dfrac{1}{\\xi}$，其中 $n<\\xi<n+1$","即 $\\dfrac{1}{n+1}<\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{n})<\\dfrac{1}{n}$.","②先证数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 单调递减","$a_{n+1}-a_{n}=\\dfrac{1}{n+1}-\\ln(n+1)+\\ln n=\\dfrac{1}{n+1}-\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{n})<0$","再证数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 有下界，","$a_{n}=1+\\dfrac{1}{2}+...+\\dfrac{1}{n}-\\ln n$","$>\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{1})+\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{2})+...+\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{n})-\\ln n$","$=\\ln(\\dfrac{2}{1}\\times\\dfrac{3}{2}...\\times\\dfrac{n+1}{n}\\times\\dfrac{1}{n})$","$=\\ln\\dfrac{n+1}{n}>0$","故数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 单调减少且有下界，所以数列 $\\{a_{n}\\}$ 收敛."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-19","num":19,"desc":"二重积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】根据二重积分的计算 $\\iint\\limits_{D}xyf''_{xy}(x,y)dxdy=\\int_{0}^{1}x\\left(\\int_{0}^{1}yf''_{xy}(x,y)dy\\right)dx$，其中","$\\int_{0}^{1}yf''_{xy}(x,y)dy=\\int_{0}^{1}ydf'_{x}(x,y)$","$=\\left(yf'_{x}(x,y)\\right)\\Big|_{y=0}^{y=1}-\\int_{0}^{1}f'_{x}(x,y)dy$","$=f'_{x}(x,1)-\\int_{0}^{1}f'_{x}(x,y)dy$","$=-\\int_{0}^{1}f'_{x}(x,y)dy$","则原式 $=\\int_{0}^{1}x\\left(-\\int_{0}^{1}f'_{x}(x,y)dy\\right)dx=-\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1}xf'_{x}(x,y)dx\\right)dy$","$=-\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1}xdf(x,y)\\right)dy=-\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(\\left(xf(x,y)\\right)\\Big|_{x=0}^{x=1}-\\int_{0}^{1}f(x,y)dx\\right)dy$","$=-\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(f(1,y)-\\int_{0}^{1}f(x,y)dx\\right)dy=\\iint\\limits_{D}f(x,y)dxdy=a$"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-20","num":20,"desc":"向量组的线性表示","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（1）易知 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$ 线性无关，由其不能被 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}$ 线性表出，得到 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}$","线性相关，从而 $r(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3})<3$. 由","$\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&3\\\\1&2&4\\\\1&3&a\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&3\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&2&a-3\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\0&1&1\\\\0&0&a-5\\end{pmatrix}$","得 $a=5$.","（2）由矩阵的初等变换","$(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}\\vdots\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3})=\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1&1&1&3\\\\0&1&3&1&2&4\\\\1&1&5&1&3&5\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1&1&1&3\\\\0&1&3&1&2&4\\\\0&1&4&0&2&2\\end{pmatrix}$","$\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1&1&1&3\\\\0&1&3&1&2&4\\\\0&0&1&-1&0&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0&2&1&5\\\\0&1&0&4&2&10\\\\0&0&1&-1&0&-2\\end{pmatrix}$","故 $\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{1}=2\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+4\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}-\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$，$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{2}=\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+2\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}$，$\\boldsymbol{\\beta}_{3}=5\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+10\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}-2\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-21","num":21,"desc":"实对称矩阵特征值与特征向量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（1）根据题意，$\\boldsymbol{A}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=-1\\times\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\boldsymbol{A}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=1\\times\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$","所以特征值 $-1$ 对应的特征向量为 $k_{1}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}$，特征值 1 对应的特征向量为 $k_{2}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$.","由 $r(\\boldsymbol{A})=2$ 知 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的另一个特征值为 0，设特征值为 0 对应的特征向量为 $k_{3}\\begin{pmatrix}x_{1}\\\\x_{2}\\\\x_{3}\\end{pmatrix}$.","因为实对称矩阵不同特征值得特征向量正交，得到 $\\begin{cases}x_{1}-x_{3}=0\\\\ x_{1}+x_{3}=0\\end{cases}$","从而特征值 0 对应的特征向量为 $k_{3}\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}$，其中 $k_{1},k_{2},k_{3}$ 为不为零的任意常数.","（2）令 $\\boldsymbol{P}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\-1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}$，则 $\\boldsymbol{P}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\-1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{1}{2}&0&-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\\\dfrac{1}{2}&0&\\dfrac{1}{2}\\\\0&1&0\\end{pmatrix}$","由 $\\boldsymbol{P}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{P}=\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}$，知","$\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{P}\\boldsymbol{\\Lambda}\\boldsymbol{P}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\-1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\\\-1&1&0\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&1\\\\0&0&0\\\\1&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$"]}]},{"id":"math-2011-22","num":22,"desc":"二维离散型随机变量","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（I）由于 $P\\left\\{X^{2}=Y^{2}\\right\\}=1$，即","$P\\left\\{X=0,Y=0\\right\\}+P\\left\\{X=1,Y=-1\\right\\}+P\\left\\{X=1,Y=1\\right\\}=1$","则有","$P\\left\\{X=1,Y=0\\right\\}=P\\left\\{X=0,Y=-\\right\\}1=P\\left\\{X=0,Y=1\\right\\}=0$","$P\\left\\{X=0,Y=0\\right\\}=P\\left\\{Y=0\\right\\}-P\\left\\{X=1,Y=0\\right\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$P\\left\\{X=1,Y=-1\\right\\}=P\\left\\{Y=-1\\right\\}-P\\left\\{X=0,Y=-1\\right\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$P\\left\\{X=1,Y=1\\right\\}=P\\left\\{Y=1\\right\\}-P\\left\\{X=0,Y=1\\right\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","所以 $(X,Y)$ 的概率分布为","$\\begin{array}{c|ccc} X\\backslash Y & -1 & 0 & 1\\\\ \\hline 0 & 0 & 1/3 & 0\\\\ 1 & 1/3 & 0 & 1/3 \\end{array}$","（II）易知随机变量 $Z$ 的可能取值为 $-1,0,1$，则有","$P\\left\\{Z=1\\right\\}=P\\left\\{X=1,Y=1\\right\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$P\\left\\{Z=-1\\right\\}=P\\left\\{X=1,Y=-1\\right\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","$P\\left\\{Z=0\\right\\}=1-P\\left\\{Z=1\\right\\}-P\\left\\{Z=-1\\right\\}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$","故 $Z=XY$ 的概率分布为","$\\begin{array}{c|ccc} Z & -1 & 0 & 1\\\\ \\hline P & 1/3 & 1/3 & 1/3 \\end{array}$","（III）由（I）和（II）知","$E(XY)=EZ=(-1)\\times\\dfrac{1}{3}+1\\times\\dfrac{1}{3}=0$","$EX=\\dfrac{2}{3}$，$EY=(-1)\\times\\dfrac{1}{3}+1\\times\\dfrac{1}{3}=0$","故有 $Cov(X,Y)=E(XY)-EXEY=0$，所以 $\\rho_{XY}=0$."]}]},{"id":"math-2011-23","num":23,"desc":"最大似然估计","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2011数学一真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】（I）设 $x_{1},x_{2},...,x_{n}$ 为对应样本观测值，故最大似然函数为","$L(\\sigma^{2})=\\prod\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}e^{-\\frac{(x_{i}-\\mu_{0})^{2}}{2\\sigma^{2}}}=(2\\pi)^{-\\frac{n}{2}}\\cdot(\\sigma^{2})^{-\\frac{n}{2}}\\cdot e^{-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(x_{i}-\\mu_{0})^{2}}$","两边同时取对数，有","$\\ln L(\\sigma^{2})=-\\dfrac{n}{2}\\ln(2\\pi)-\\dfrac{n}{2}\\ln(\\sigma^{2})-\\dfrac{1}{2\\sigma^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(x_{i}-\\mu_{0})^{2}$","令 $\\dfrac{d\\ln L(\\sigma^{2})}{d(\\sigma^{2})}=-\\dfrac{n}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{\\sigma^{2}}+\\dfrac{1}{2(\\sigma^{2})^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(x_{i}-\\mu_{0})^{2}=0$，可得 $\\sigma^{2}=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(x_{i}-\\mu_{0})^{2}$.","所以 $Y$ 的最大似然估计为 $\\hat{\\sigma}^{2}=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(X_{i}-\\mu_{0})^{2}$.","（II）由（I）知，由于 $X_{i}\\sim N(\\mu_{0},\\sigma^{2})(i=1,2,\\cdots,n)$，则有 $\\dfrac{X_{i}-\\mu_{0}}{\\sigma}\\sim N(0,1)(i=1,2,\\cdots,n)$，","所以 $\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\left(\\dfrac{X_{i}-\\mu_{0}}{\\sigma}\\right)^{2}\\sim\\chi^{2}(n)$，所以有","$E\\left(\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\left(\\dfrac{X_{i}-\\mu_{0}}{\\sigma}\\right)^{2}\\right)=n$, $D\\left(\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\left(\\dfrac{X_{i}-\\mu_{0}}{\\sigma}\\right)^{2}\\right)=2n$","故","$E\\hat{\\sigma}^{2}=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}E(X_{i}-\\mu_{0})^{2}=\\sigma^{2}$,","$D\\hat{\\sigma}^{2}=D\\left(\\dfrac{\\sigma^{2}}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\left(\\dfrac{X_{i}-\\mu_{0}}{\\sigma}\\right)^{2}\\right)=\\dfrac{\\sigma^{4}}{n^{2}}D\\left(\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\left(\\dfrac{X_{i}-\\mu_{0}}{\\sigma}\\right)^{2}\\right)=\\dfrac{2\\sigma^{4}}{n}$."]}]}]}